%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/processor_test.clj:880 (exec-transform-output-json-test)
testing: Execute transform with header var declarations
元の形: DW スクリプト
元テストは parse だけで評価していない
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
var x = 42
var items = [{a: 1}, {a: 2}]
---
{
  x: x,
  mapped: items map $.a
}
%%% output application/json
{
  "x": 42,
  "mapped": [
    1,
    2
  ]
}
